vaevictis-hardening (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First version: the SSH, firewall, kernel and Firefox settings of
    VaeVictis OS 1.3 for systems installed from 1.1 or 1.2. Each file is
    replaced only if it is exactly the one those images installed; the SSH
    settings wait until every authorized key is ed25519.
  * Fixes from an AI-assisted review (Argon by Google; not an independent
    security audit), before publication: the check of the authorized keys
    asks sshd itself, account by account (also with Match blocks, with SSH
    switched off and without host keys), also reads every file sshd reads
    (Include lines followed), reads key options as sshd does, and also
    stops for certificates, AuthorizedKeysCommand, accounts from a
    directory service and key files root cannot read; ssh.service
    starts after nftables; the XMAS rule compares all six TCP flags; a
    locally changed SSH port drop-in leaves the whole firewall alone.

